Scope: this license covers dataimago's own files in this repository, namely
README.md, CLAUDE.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, LICENSE, registry.json, docs/,
profiles/ (the institution profiles, their schema and their test files),
tools/, tests/, .github/, the README.md in each classes/<institution-id>/
directory, and the example book under classes/dataimago-thesis/example/ (a
starting point an author copies; what the author then writes is the author's).

It does not cover the house class under classes/dataimago-thesis/ (the .cls
file, the Lua generator and filter, and the Quarto partials; not its
example/), which is under
the LaTeX Project Public License 1.3c, as that directory's README.md records.
It does not cover third-party document classes, macros or example documents
under classes/; those keep their own terms, as each class's README.md records.
